# Feedback register

When the user asks for housekeeping, bug fixes, polish, or “what’s broken,” first read:

1. `docs/feedback-inbox.md`
2. `data/feedback.json` (if present)

Prefer open `bug` and `housekeeping` items. The in-app register is Development Inbox (`/d?tab=inbox`). Capture UI is global (header / mobile FAB).

Do not invent feedback items; only act on what’s logged unless the user adds more in chat.
